    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be hwearfe. ⁊ nan mon ne hwyrfe nanes yrfes buton ðæs gerefan gewitnesse oððe þæs mæssepreostes oððe þæs londhlafordes oþþe þæs horderes oððe oþres ungelygnes monnes. Gif hit hwa dó, gesylle XXX scll' to wite, ⁊ fó se londhlaford to þam hwearfe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no one shall exchange any cattle unless he has as witness the reeve or the mass-priest, or the landowner, or the treasurer, or some other trustworthy man. If anyone does so, he shall pay a fine of 30 shillings, and the landowner shall take what has been exchanged.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be yrfa gehwyrfe. Ðæt nán man ne hwyrfe nanes yrfes butan ðæs gerefan gewitnysse oþþe þæs mæssepreostes oþþe ðæs hordres oþþe ðæs landhlafordes oþþe oþres ungeligenes mannes. Gif hit hwa dó, gylde XXX scill., ⁊ fó se landhlaforde to ðæm gehwyrfe.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
